==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*5 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 0.67~1 seconds<sup>20f~30f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Wild Doge]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Ms. Sign]] spawns after 666.67 seconds<sup>20,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A rather easy stage as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] outranges all enemies here, but you may want to bring more meatshields to protect your backliners, as Wild Doges can push very hard.

